# The trial ledger is append-mostly and is written from many branches. A union merge
# lets two branches add different trials without adjudication; tests/test_ledger_integrity.py
# then enforces uniqueness, sort order and the monotonic row-count floor.
# Rationale: this file used to be a parquet, which git cannot merge, and it forked into
# four divergent copies -- one of which alone held five sealed-holdout looks.
output/trial_ledger.jsonl merge=union linguist-generated=false
